%% WiFi Test Orchestrator architecture baseline 0.1.0
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant S as Task and Lease Service
    participant Q as Persistent execution queue
    participant P as Allowlisted provider
    participant T as Telemetry Service
    participant R as Result and Artifact Services

    A->>S: Poll by outbound HTTPS
    S->>Q: Find compatible non-expired work
    Q-->>S: Candidate task
    S-->>A: Immutable task plus lease
    A->>A: Validate versions, capabilities, reservation and policy
    A->>A: Persist acceptance and idempotency locally
    A->>P: Execute registered action
    loop While platform and lease permit
        A->>S: Renew lease
        A->>T: Send metric envelopes
    end
    P-->>A: Raw provider result
    A->>R: Idempotent result and artifact metadata
    R-->>A: Acknowledge persisted outcome
    A->>S: Complete with current lease ownership
    S->>Q: Mark terminal or recoverable state
